Scene geometry is authored for this task under the repository's Apache-2.0 license.
No commercial warehouse pack or private research-lab environment is redistributed.

Photo textures: Poly Haven, CC0-1.0 (https://polyhaven.com/license).
The pinned URLs and SHA-256 hashes are in image/visual_assets.json:
https://polyhaven.com/a/concrete_floor_02
https://polyhaven.com/a/asphalt_02
https://polyhaven.com/a/brick_wall_001
https://polyhaven.com/a/rusty_metal_02
https://polyhaven.com/a/utility_box_01
https://polyhaven.com/a/portable_generator
https://polyhaven.com/a/concrete_road_barrier
Powered by Poly Haven. Discovery uses its public API only at authoring time;
container builds use pinned URLs and SHA-256 hashes. Mesh/texture conversion is
reproducible with image/fetch_visual_assets.py and its pinned dependencies.

CPU PBR rendering uses MuJoCo 3.16.0 Filament and the lighting probe distributed
inside that Apache-2.0 package. No probe from a commercial environment is copied.

Nominal robot visual meshes: Google DeepMind MuJoCo Menagerie at
f3b6013629c7b94f8ee93fd977b161fa8350f9bc.
Crazyflie and Unitree Go1 original license texts accompany this file.
These are simplified benchmark dynamics, not manufacturer-certified digital twins.
